headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "planId": "clxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
    "service": "RECOMMENDATION",
    "successUrl": "http://localhost:3000/dashboard/billing?success=true",
    "cancelUrl": "http://localhost:3000/dashboard/billing?canceled=true"
  }
}

docs {
  ## POST /api/retailer/billing/checkout

  Creates a Stripe Checkout session for subscribing to a Manikan service plan.
  Returns a Stripe-hosted checkout URL the frontend should redirect to.

  ### Body
  | Field      | Type   | Required | Description                                |
  |------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------|
  | planId     | string | ✅       | Prisma Plan ID to subscribe to             |
  | service    | string | ✅       | `"RECOMMENDATION"`, `"VTON_2D"`, `"BODY_MODELING"` |
  | successUrl | string | ✅       | Redirect URL after successful payment      |
  | cancelUrl  | string | ✅       | Redirect URL if checkout is abandoned      |

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  { "checkoutUrl": "https://checkout.stripe.com/pay/cs_test_..." }
  ```

  ### Notes
  - Webhook at `/api/webhooks/billing` listens for `checkout.session.completed`
    to activate the subscription in the DB (never trust the redirect URL alone).
}
